        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba bonse abena Moabu ilyo baumfwile ukuti ishamfumu nashima ukwisa mukubalwisha, baimishe umwaume onse, umwaice nangu umukote uwingalwa ulubuli, baisa mwimika ku mupaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo babuuka ulucelo, basanga akasuba nakasanika pa menshi. Ku lubali lwa bena Moabu amenshi yalemoneka ayakashika kwati mulopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo basosa abati, “Mulopa ulya, ni shilya imfumu shifwile nashilwa no kwipayana. Mwe bena Moabu twendeni mukutapa icuma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
