          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baonaula imisumba, na cila muntu aposapo ilibwe pebala ilisuma mpaka lyafimbwa. Bacilika utumfukumfuku twa menshi no kutemaula imiti iyisuma yonse. Kanofye Kiri Hareseti eo bashilekofye na mabwe yonse umo yaikalila. Nomba abaume abali na malekeni baushinguluka no kuusansa nao wine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
