          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo imfumu ya ku Moabu yamona ukuti ulubuli lwaikosela, yaima yasenda abaume abalwila ku lupanga imyanda cine lubali (700) ukwesha ukupatikisha ukuti ifike ku mfumu ya ku Edomu, nomba yafilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo yabuula umwana wakwe ibeli umwaume, uwali nokuipyana pa bufumu, yamutuula ilambo pelinga lya musumba. Abena Moabu epakufulilwa abena Israeli icine cine, baima babwelela na ku calo cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
